rtifacts as FigureAsset/SourceVisualReceipt evidence inputs and schema references only, not KG schema definitions.\n\n## Count Readback\n\n- Real 9709 question rows: 3530\n- Normalized plain-text rows: 3530\n- Text-only ready rows: 2672\n- Visual-required rows: 858\n- SourceVisualReceipt coverage rows: 858\n- Accepted SourceVisualReceipt rows: 159\n- SourceFigureAsset production index rows: 858\n- Visual terminal blocker rows: 699\n- Student-display eligible visual rows: 0\n- External VLM calls in closeout: 0\n\n## Verification\n\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-kg-source-artifact-ingestion-manifest.mjs`\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/kg-source-artifact-ingestion-manifest.test.js`\n- `ESLINT_USE_FLAT_CONFIG=true npx eslint scripts/method-map/build-kg-source-artifact-ingestion-manifest.mjs scripts/method-map/__tests__/kg-source-artifact-ingestion-manifest.test.js`\n- `git diff --check`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` (warning-only: branch naming/dirty worktree before commit; artifact guard passed)\n\n## Boundaries\n\n- No schema migration.\n- No Supabase import or mutation.\n- No runtime/frontend changes.\n- KG contract/compiler/output gaps are explicit `blocked_missing` entries sequenced to downstream KG-HVY issues.\n","created_at":"2026-07-05T06:59:57Z","updated_at":"2026-07-05T07:11:36Z","closed_at":"2026-07-05T07:11:36Z","merged_at":"2026-07-05T07:11:36Z","merge_commit_sha":"fe4e5f976ea713f601abe0aba507dd4067be86d2","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1297/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1297/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1297/comments","statuses